<section>
  <p class="kicker"><%= link_to_page "guides", label_type: :nav, class: "cta" %></p>
  <h1>In sight, and held fast.</h1>
  <p class="lede">A clamp on the glareshield, a ball joint and a quick release. We ordered these parts and tested them.</p>
</section>

<section id="go" class="band band--tint">
  <h2 class="section-title">skyBlip Go</h2>
  <div class="faq">
    <div class="table-scroll">
      <table class="modules">
        <thead><tr><th>Part</th><th>Where to find it</th><th>Price</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><th>Disc</th><td><a href="https://www.aliexpress.com/item/1005008735044863.html">Flat 1/4&Prime; disc</a>, variant Type A, Ver.2, with an adhesive back</td><td>€5.89</td></tr>
          <tr><th>Screws</th><td><a href="https://www.aliexpress.com/item/1005002281189492.html">M3 ultra-thin wafer head screws</a>, M3&nbsp;x&nbsp;6 and M3&nbsp;x&nbsp;8</td><td>&mdash;</td></tr>
          <tr><th>Quick release, male</th><td>QS-1 plate, in the <a href="https://s.click.aliexpress.com/e/_c4rEgYRR" target="_blank" rel="sponsored">XILETU quick release kit</a>, variant Q-1</td><td>€3.39</td></tr>
          <tr><th>Quick release, female</th><td>QD-1 base, in the same kit</td><td>&mdash;</td></tr>
          <tr><th>Ball socket</th><td><a href="https://s.click.aliexpress.com/e/_c3181RVr" target="_blank" rel="sponsored">17&nbsp;mm ball socket with a locking ring</a></td><td>€1.02</td></tr>
          <tr><th>Ball</th><td><a href="https://www.aliexpress.com/item/1005007754077062.html">Aluminium 17&nbsp;mm ball on a 1/4&Prime; screw</a>, variant Ball 17mm</td><td>€3.29</td></tr>
          <tr><th>Clamp</th><td><a href="https://s.click.aliexpress.com/e/_c2xJTaW9" target="_blank" rel="sponsored">Andoer crab clamp</a>, metal, 1/4&Prime; and 3/8&Prime; holes</td><td>€7.79</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>
  <ol class="steps-grid steps-grid--sequence">
    <li><h3>Drill the disc.</h3><p>Drill two M3 holes in the disc, 14&nbsp;mm either side of its centre, clear of the central insert.</p></li>
    <li><h3>Fix it to the Go.</h3><p>Press the disc on the back of the Go and drive the two screws. Pick M3&nbsp;x&nbsp;6 or M3&nbsp;x&nbsp;8 so the thread that enters the Go, the length less the disc, suits it.</p></li>
    <li><h3>Assemble.</h3><p>Screw the male plate into the disc, the female base onto the socket, and the ball into the clamp. Close the clamp on the glareshield, press the socket onto the ball, click the Go in, aim it and tighten the ring.</p></li>
  </ol>
</section>

